  "jcr:description": "The NanoTack Flex System is designed to facilitate anchor placement within close proximity to the rim from many trajectories because of its flexible delivery system and small size. Matched anchor and drill hole trajectories along with 2 stage fixation are designed to yield pin-point placement and seamless implantation. The NanoTack Flex System is designed with the hip in mind to allow for anatomic labrum restoration.",
