      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Flexible delivery system may facilitate increased safety margins by reducing joint penetration with multiple angles of approach.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Simplistic coinciding anchor and pilot hole trajectory are designed to allow for seamless implantation where intended.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Compact, high-strength implant yields fixation strength comparable to larger anchors<sup>1</sup> which may allow for optimization of patient outcomes.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
